@startuml
Title Shared Vehicle Lifecycle

state Available
state Reserved
state InUse
state UnderMaintenance
state Redistributing

[*] --> Available
Available --> Reserved : Reservation Confirmed
Reserved --> Available : Reservation Cancelled / Allocation Released
Reserved --> InUse : Pickup Validated / Rental Started
InUse --> Available : Return Completed / Vehicle Operational
InUse --> UnderMaintenance : Return Completed / Vehicle Faulted
Reserved --> UnderMaintenance : Vehicle Found Not Operational
UnderMaintenance --> Available : Vehicle Restored To Service
Available --> Redistributing : No Available Vehicle Found 
Redistributing --> Available : Redistribution Completed

@enduml
